WEBVTT

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:39.600
Hey, wait!!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.490
Thanks!

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.450
Someone's all
the way out here?

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:49.260
Are you nuts?!

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:55.220
Hey!
Are you okay?!

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.100
What's going on here?

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:12.330
Just a little higher, Gao.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:15.040
Come with me...

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:28.760
Good...

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.090
Nice catch!

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:37.690
Huh?

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.150
He's gone...

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:55.820
I hope you're well, Takao.

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:58.700
I shouldn't even have to ask.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.320
All of us on Baihuzu
are doing great.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:05.930
We started practicing for the next world championship tournament.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:09.480
Training. Making the
best out of every day.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:13.340
We're growing
together as a team.

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:16.980
Takao, we won't
lose next time!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.850
--Rei!

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:27.730
A mysterious boy who came
and went with the wind...

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:30.850
It almost sounds like
you've seen a ghost.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:34.420
Ghosts don't go diving
into waterfalls.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:38.420
Sounds less like a ghost
and more like a mage!

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.540
It's gotta be a bird!

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:44.960
It flew like a bird
and saved a cat!

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:50.360
A ghost, a mage,
a bird, a cat...

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.530
I suppose it
doesn't matter.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:17.180
I guess the full moon is
the cause of all this fun.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:28.210
Shoot!

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.460
Is that right?

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:52.490
It came as a real surprise to me. He did some awful stuff as the coach of the Borg team.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:58.000
But it doesn't look
like he's so bad now.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.140
Volkov changed?

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:01.770
That, and...

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:14.690
My Beybattle with Moses.
He's a real Blader.

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:17.680
Volkov isn't
manipulating him.

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:25.780
I can't tell if Volkov is a
good guy or a bad guy!!

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.640
He shorted out.

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:34.820
Takao's right. We can't be so quick to trust him after what he did...

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:39.800
We just have to wait
and see what he does.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:47.200
I don't think that borscht
guy is all that bad.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:49.400
'Cuz he gave me a gift.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.970
--It's not borscht, it's Volkov!
--It's not borscht, it's Volkov!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.160
These cookies are great!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:58.530
Is anyone who gives
you food a good guy?

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:02.520
What about your
training journey?!

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:04.610
Oh yeah.

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:06.840
Look...

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.210
They love playing
up the drama.

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:19.330
"Takao Kinomiya Joins BEGA?!"

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:23.000
It would be great if
this becomes reality.

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:28.420
And not just him.

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:31.720
Daichi Sumeragi. Kai Hiwatari.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:35.360
Max Mizuhara. And Rei Kon.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:39.200
BEGA is waiting
for you to join us.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:44.290
--Three! Two! One!

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.660
--Go, Shoot!

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:50.130
Go, Driger!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.800
It's a new record!

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:06.650
No, I'm aiming for the top!

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:15.330
That's it, Driger.
Just a little more!

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:37.160
We were so close to
having some to eat.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.900
You're so greedy!

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:41.060
But it's such a waste!

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:44.210
You'll have to sprout wings
if you want to eat them!

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:47.140
Flap flap!
I'm a little birdie!

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:57.360
Who did that?

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.930
Let's go home, guys.

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:08.440
I saw them yesterday...

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:10.960
He's...

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:14.180
I see. It was you.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:20.740
Once we get back
I'll cook something tasty!

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.170
A bird?

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.720
--A person?

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:43.970
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:54.250
So pretty...

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.450
This feels great.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.880
Hey there!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:12.740
What's your name?

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:16.010
You're the ghost
from the waterfall!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.530
The mage!

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:19.780
--The bird!
--The bird!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:24.320
You all saw
the same person?

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:30.740
How funny that we ran
into each other yesterday!

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:35.290
What's so funny about dropping down like that so many times?!

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:38.770
I don't "fall." I can fly.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:39.980
Who the heck are you?

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:42.950
M-y-s-t-e-l.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.910
Mystel?
You can't be serious!

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:48.400
I'm 100% serious!

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:49.820
Get back here!

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:53.300
He's flying!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:55.850
Stop!

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:58.050
If I stop,
will you chill out?

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:02.290
No! You're the reason I'm
mad in the first place!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:03.980
Rai, that's enough!

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:05.200
--Wait!
Rai, that's enough!

00:11:05.200 --> 00:11:06.300
Rai, that's enough!

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:10.050
Enough? I haven't
done anything yet!

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.400
Help me out here!

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.970
Stop, you!

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:17.340
Cut it out!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.250
I've had enough!

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:25.420
Are you okay?

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:27.290
Obviously not!

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:28.610
Sorry.

00:11:28.610 --> 00:11:31.340
Why don't you
try apologizing first?

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:57.360
Hurry!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.580
He can jump pretty high...

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:05.560
Mao, you don't
have to feed him.

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:10.020
I do! He got my
ribbon for me.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.250
Whatever!

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:15.380
--Thanks for the meal!
--Thanks for the meal!

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:18.880
Eat up!

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:21.580
The loquat!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:22.540
What's this?

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:25.000
I found it on
the way here.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:28.960
Really? Then I'll
gladly have some.

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.060
I hope you
didn't steal it.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:35.020
Don't worry. It's straight
from mother nature!

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:38.180
From a place
no one can reach.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:53.250
He reached that?

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:54.340
Yeah.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.130
No way.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:13:01.420
There's no
place to climb up.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:07.060
Only a bird could
make it up there.

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:09.180
But what if he was one?

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.900
What do you mean?

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:14.810
I think he can do it.

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:19.680
He did come flying
down like a bird...

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:24.080
Well, maybe he could...

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:34.500
I'm joking.
Something's up with me today.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:38.120
Yeah, same for me.
I must be crazy.

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:41.330
Mystel?

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:43.330
What's so funny, huh?!

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:46.420
You won't get them to
fall by staring at them!

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:49.160
I knew it!
So you can...

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.360
A Blader!

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:56.250
You can take down the
loquat with your Bey?

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:59.970
No way. Even we
can't pull that off.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:02.450
Just watch.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:15.640
--He jumped...
--Straight up!

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:16.760
Shoot!

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:32.300
See?

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:44.840
I don't know who he is,
but I'm excited to fight him!

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:46.960
Rai, concentrate.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:48.570
I know.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:49.660
Let's go!

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:53.700
--Three! Two! One!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.960
--Go, Shoot!

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:58.220
One strike, one kill!

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:05.000
He deflected Rai's power!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:09.980
That was a heavy hit. This must be the
level of a world championship player.

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:12.820
Compliments won't
get you any favors.

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:13.850
Here I go!

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:21.880
This is the end!

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.780
Spiral Lightning!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:32.850
That's a wrap.

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:34.080
Not yet!

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:37.920
A sore loser?

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:40.240
I can fly.

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.160
Higher!

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:48.250
Yes! Fly!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:51.180
Howl!
Growl, Poseidon!

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:10.200
Ocean Javelin!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.570
What?!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.370
Darn!

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:41.340
The wind power created
from his jumps...

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:46.800
He converts the headwind of his opponent's power into his own!

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:52.300
Then he uses the tailwinds as
his own high-powered attack!

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.920
Becoming the wind,
riding the tailwinds...

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:58.970
Consuming
the headwinds...

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:01.730
He's the wind itself!

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:05.490
His Poseidon controls the
great sea of the skies above!

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:11.700
--Three! Two! One!
--Three! Two! One!

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:13.660
--Go, Shoot!

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:17.660
Go, Driger!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.140
What irregular attacks!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.330
I've never seen a
Blader like this before!

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:29.370
Now it's my turn!

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.970
This time he used the
wall to jump off!

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:44.840
He's so powerful!

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:50.820
You're good. I've never seen
anyone dodge that before.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.420
Well, allow me
to keep going!

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:12.450
I have to hang on.
Once he stops...

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.160
I'll go in once
the wind subsides!

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:17.650
Here I come!

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:22.420
Let's go, Poseidon!

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.760
Now! Gatling Claw!

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:43.570
Howl! Attack!

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:48.260
Oh no!

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:50.600
Look out!

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:55.700
Are you okay?

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:58.260
Yeah. I messed up.

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.860
You're really strong!

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:08.170
So are you.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:10.040
Sorry for making fun of you.

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:17.610
I hope there's another world
championship tournament.

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:19.260
World championship?

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:23.780
There's something
even more amazing now!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:29.460
A pro league in place of
the BBA. It's called BEGA!

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:32.900
I'm a Blader registered
with that league.

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:34.250
The BBA is gone?

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:35.370
A pro league?

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:39.560
Yeah. Naturally, you two
will join BEGA, right?

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.680
That's a bad joke!

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:46.200
I figured.
It is new, after all.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:50.010
Takao Kinomiya had
a similar reaction.

00:19:50.010 --> 00:19:51.120
At first, anyway.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.560
At first?

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.320
What did Takao do after?

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:59.040
He joined BEGA after
understanding what we're about.

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:03.850
I can't believe he would do
that without talking to us first.

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:05.380
Yeah, exactly!

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:09.800
Strange things have been happening
ever since you showed up.

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:20.000
That was fun!

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.490
Take these.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:26.690
Thank you.

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:27.840
Thanks for these.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.240
See you later.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:30.580
Take care.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.780
I'll be waiting!

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:37.300
What a strange guy.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:39.820
Saying the BBA
is gone and stuff...

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.290
Right?

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:43.080
Yeah...

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:47.020
Mystel!

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:49.920
Take me with you.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:51.090
Rei!

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:52.930
Don't worry.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.450
Do you believe him?

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:56.500
I'm not sure.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:57.450
So why?

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:01.280
But I don't think
he's lying, either.

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.840
You should be able to
tell after battling him.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:05.180
Well...

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:08.140
I didn't get a sense
of malice from him.

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:11.170
So I'm going to find out
the truth for myself!

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:18.330
To see it for myself...
With my own two eyes!

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:28.450
--Be careful, Rei!
--Good luck!

00:22:55.800 --> 00:22:58.230
They say I'm
gonna join BEGA?

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:03.200
A pro league sounds great,
but I can't trust Volkov.

00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:06.080
Aww, man!
What should I do?!

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:10.200
There's no need to hesitate!
We're going to go crush BEGA ourselves.

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:13.290
Wait, Yuriy?!
What are you doing here?

00:23:13.290 --> 00:23:16.000
I've got business to settle
with Volkov, once and for all.

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:18.800
But before I do,
I'm glad we met.

00:23:18.800 --> 00:23:22.460
What's that supposed
to mean, Yuriy?!
